-validated, tier-checked, resource-checked, cooldown-checked, and transactional.</p></div></div>';const check=document.getElementById('ascension-check');if(check)check.onclick=()=>{const b=document.getElementById('global-feedback');if(b){b.style.display='block';b.dataset.state=a.eligible?'ready':'locked';b.textContent=a.eligible?'Eligibility confirmed: all Ascension requirements are satisfied.':'Eligibility checked: complete the listed progression, Glory, Reputation, and technology requirements before ascending.'}}}function vacationPage(){const v=state.vacation||{},b=v.blocking_operations||{},cd=v.cooldown||{};const active=Boolean(v.active);const csrf=state.csrf||'';document.getElementById('section').textContent='ACCOUNT';document.getElementById('title').textContent='Vacation Mode';document.getElementById('description').textContent='Vacation Mode — '+(v.formula||'vacation protection = account lock + fleet lock + colony production pause');const missions=(b.missions||[]).map(m=>'<div class="row"><span>'+esc(m.mission_type||'MISSION')+'</span><strong>'+esc(m.status||'ACTIVE')+'</strong></div>').join('');document.getElementById('content').innerHTML='<div class="cc-grid"><div class="card wide"><div class="eyebrow">CURRENT PROTECTION</div><h2>Vacation protection <span class="badge '+(active?'good':'')+'">'+(active?'ACTIVE':'INACTIVE')+'</span></h2><div class="metric-grid"><div class="metric"><span>Account lock</span><strong>'+(active?'LOCKED':'OPEN')+'</strong><small>Mutating account actions are restricted.</small></div><div class="metric"><span>Fleet lock</span><strong>'+(active?'LOCKED':'OPEN')+'</strong><small>Fleet dispatch is paused during protection.</small></div><div class="metric"><span>Colony production</span><strong>'+(active?'PAUSED':'RUNNING')+'</strong><small>Turn settlement honors vacation state.</small></div></div></div><div class="card side-card"><div class="eyebrow">PAGE CONTROLS</div><h2>Activation rules</h2><form method="post" action="actions/game.php" 